- **closed**: The anti-ransomware capacity was exceeded, and the system disabled the policy.', example='disabled'),
      remarkedUuidList?: [ string ](name='RemarkedUuidList', description='The list of UUIDs of servers returned after the search by the MachineRemark request parameter.'),
