>>- **0**: Plug-in Online. 
>>- **1**: Plug-in Disabled. 
>>- **2**: Plug-in Offline. 
>>- **-99**: The installation failed. 
>- When **Name** is **yundunMonitorStatus**, the enum values are: 
>>- **0**: Plug-in Online. 
>>- **1**: Plug-in Disabled. 
>>- **2**: Plug-in Offline. 
>>- **-99**: The installation failed. 
>- When **Name** is **clusterNodeStatus**, the enum values are: 
>>- **false**: No. 
>>- **true**: Yes.', example='47.96.XX.XX'),
    }
  ](name='CriteriaList', description='List of asset query condition information.'),
