- **threat_type**: the threat type. The value is an array. The elements in the array can be network layer intrusion, network service scanning, network sharing and discovery, mining pool, exploits, darknet, malicious logon, malicious download source, central control, web shell, and web attack.', example='[{"threat_type_desc": "挖矿程序","risk_type": 1,"threat_type": ""}]'),
